{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "46ed7a45c8ee1975d13f00e60b767f13ec11010f67b32568b419f028f8a42bd3", "ja": "超覚醒！　王者の生き方", "zh": "超级觉醒！王者的生存之道", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "da9959c6658cabd86740018aa4519b4e72a50b6ccfc725417582095e090d5b58", "ja": "撮影が始まったが、まだ悪役としての演技に\n悩んでいる風花。プロデューサーの助言から\n海美に相談する。海美は、過去に役柄と重な\nる部分があったと言い、風花も役柄と共通点\nを探すことで、役を掴むことに成功した。", "zh": "电影开拍了，风花却仍在烦恼如何诠释反派。\n她听从制作人的建议，去询问海美的看法。\n海美说自己的过去有和角色重叠的部分，\n风花也借由寻找自己和角色的共通点，\n成功掌握住角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f0270ae11aa55670145455ee214d974bd00cc842ad62049b7979851a8edaece7", "ja": "（いよいよ撮影初日だ。今日までみんな、しっかりと\nレッスンに励んできた。いい演技ができるはずだ！）", "zh": "（终于到了开始拍摄的第一天。至今为止，\n大家都有认真努力地训练，想必能演得很好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1001_staff", "source_sha256": "9831e5c1ee92d87c24f88aad781a1d41fc4bf01082885cd723e173afc9d86ec9", "ja": "それじゃ、カメラ回しまーす！\n3……2……、……カチン！", "zh": "那么摄影机要开始拍了～！\n3……2…………喀锵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "f6bbd4570793059fd947cb63baf8e02fc98d8fd56eeefba46a99751d352f6605", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。\nあ、相変わらず、強いね……キング。", "zh": "呼，呼……\n你、你还是一样强呢……王者。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e3c0f9117d49e099bf5056261e69d29b574cd867a57bd04ad5403b3c89da6430", "ja": "紗代子。あなたは本当に、弱くなったわね。\nあなたではもう、私の渇きは満たせないのかしら……？", "zh": "纱代子，你真的变弱了呢。\n你已经没办法满足我的渴望了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "a2ae069648208006fe60772aba672f25de47350e9858dce97e2e01e9a6d18b50", "ja": "ククク……黄金期の名プレーヤーも、哀れなもんやで。\n未来とか言うたか？　さっき吹っ飛んでったヤツ。", "zh": "呵呵呵……黄金时代的知名球员，竟然沦落至此呀。\n刚才被打飞的那家伙，名字叫未来是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "18c68c2759d3336d8f20cbe4c7f0222ed6077b3ba25771b736e3f0f6d8dd1e92", "ja": "あんな雑魚しか、パートナーのなり手が\nおらんねんからなぁ！", "zh": "也只有那种三流货色\n愿意跟你搭档啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "43f72ef068eeae7d624773d8e8f4ead2e221036c9597d48b24c47046c4d17a5d", "ja": "未来ちゃんを悪く言わないで！　未来ちゃんは、\n私と一緒にこの部を守ってくれた、仲間なんだから！", "zh": "不准说未来的坏话！\n未来她是跟我一起保护了这个社团的伙伴啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "1806c54be063d61f93784fa1426b9f0d5d6d76939cff7f856ce8efe7a11051b3", "ja": "コートに友情ごっこはいらんねん！\nもうええ、これでとどめや……。", "zh": "球场上不需要玩友情游戏！\n够了，这下就是最后一击……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "d44c656ee3e0bdd4362daf8e71ca37e3f200adaca278236e8f09abca5cb48f59", "ja": "バーニング～", "zh": "燃烧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "39c3b04ed5524957b3ebb8f4b20b0183eb59c2c8f54d1589b0ae712d79decd79", "ja": "オクトパスッ！", "zh": "八爪鱼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1010_se", "source_sha256": "3f909be2f65698ed07d5ec16073111d8ba5b75995459ba12801b002f1955afb2", "ja": "ジュウウウウウウッ！", "zh": "咻──────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "102fdfa1f44fd54cb2917f39e4dec24e46a2786e531a57949ba7243a42aa9445", "ja": "くっ、もう腕が……！\n海美……！", "zh": "呜，我的手臂已经……！\n海美……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1012_se", "source_sha256": "4f282e6e476cec17e39f9ac51160370ef3efca632dd90b1a3cb65612e3e6ca25", "ja": "ドゴーンッ！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "5f2cf5c5ca821f6f91a8c7df44c57b1a3c6aaf4bcf528b6991cf02df6c76abb4", "ja": "……えっ？\nう、海美！？　それに、恵美ちゃん……！", "zh": "……咦？\n海、海美！？还有惠美也……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "b5eeef880a3af0be08df5b10ba1465b721052cd8460f22e8c0118e5f4b1cf122", "ja": "……。あんたたちが帝花女学院の、\nキングとクイーンか……よくも、紗代子を……。", "zh": "……你们就是帝花女子学院的王者和女王吗……\n你们竟敢害纱代子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "94cbaf7f9613a84d0d3fe7b2605aa8a21a6dad116cf25e43da97658745dd9ddd", "ja": "私のお姉ちゃんを、傷つけたなっ！！", "zh": "竟敢害我的姊姊受伤！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "d9dea55482719514e59a84e0fa78259906b90904ee34cf8f2cfdaa3a3ce06242", "ja": "海美……！　海美がコートに、戻ってきた……。\nう、ううっ……。", "zh": "海美……！海美回到球场来了……\n呜、呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "df368b9ef5f039fbf32d5ecd6720e92980aff21da1dde31e4bc00dddbd3e7587", "ja": "海美、アタシ、まだヘタクソかもしれないけど……。\n一緒に戦いたい！　背中は任せてっ！", "zh": "海美，我可能还打得很糟……\n但我想要和你一起战斗！你的背后就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "10a7fb98f4df96a6ebfebcfb42151e29b076e31bacfbc535cfbc8d03b0c4e6b7", "ja": "私のバーニングオクトパスを打ち返すなんて……。\nふ、ふん、少しはやるようやな！", "zh": "居然能击回我的燃烧八爪鱼……\n呃、哼，看来还挺有两把刷子的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5dd697fd3a5b07fdca2d1922fd109811950f6dbd07246b11422d58b1a189e1b7", "ja": "そう、あなたが噂の新入生ね……面白いわ。\nクイーン、次はあなたがトスを上げて。", "zh": "所以，你就是传闻中的新生啊……真有趣。\n女王，下一球换你来举球。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "10390f184e90a261744addd93005da9a22c417e61eab8a8a28043989f308db43", "ja": "えっ！？　キング……待ってや！\nまだ私は負けてへん！", "zh": "咦！？王者……等等啊！\n我还没有输！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d051a73fc0185a3b987026cb1e39c353e2fb40cbaf3e678d96ddf08eef967104", "ja": "わかってる。ただ、試してみたいの。\nあの子たちが、私の渇きを満たせるかどうか……。", "zh": "我知道。我只是想试试看，\n那两个女孩究竟能不能满足我的渴望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ed2c26bed463030c069c5306815a25929404b7087f0dba290c17ac31e192642e", "ja": "私のバレーは重力のバレー！\nさあ、おいでなさい！　グラビティの世界へ！！", "zh": "我的排球是地心引力排球！\n来吧，欢迎进入重力的世界！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "04a032d7a479bef4148de801af540decd27a9374b4fe60ea64ed42bcfb22e353", "ja": "ぷ、ぷっ……あ、あはははっ！\nご、ごめん、ちょっ……！", "zh": "噗、噗……哈、哈哈哈！\n抱、抱歉，等等……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1024_kantoku", "source_sha256": "273379fd546ed70a75b0ab61dc569815c838a8f9933ee1356f6c7eb4f1e7ba95", "ja": "はい、カットー！", "zh": "好，卡──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "f65a16d4a8c72f61150f4b27cffc306ac251786ca45788a233563f901794c832", "ja": "あーっ！？　ごめんなさいっ！", "zh": "啊──！？对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1026_kantoku", "source_sha256": "e8e750e962291b6f911d7a12ed84b9e45ea62bb497edbde246d13c71a27fdfbd", "ja": "大丈夫でーす。\nちょっと続いちゃったんで、休憩入れましょうか。", "zh": "没关系──\n这一段拍得有点长了，休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1027_null", "source_sha256": "a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78", "ja": "休憩中……", "zh": "休息中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1028_p", "source_sha256": "065b8f6a8a72d63ef8ff16dab2458183d5a113a0935a6d3a053c37a588618398", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ！　いい感じだったじゃないか。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！拍得很不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "12897f68a5f7ccadd83f8415082b6a4b68bf393af1d9b697c20d85da8b36c5df", "ja": "{$P$}……みんなもごめんね！\nバーニングまではこらえたんだけどな～……。", "zh": "{$P$}……还有大家，抱歉！\n喊燃烧的时候我还有忍住的说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "da85ca4ecd93eec5f7fb759ad70527b97c21633a9fe37107dbea6bd82c9c0ebe", "ja": "しょうがないよ～！　あはははっ☆\n私もなおーたちの悪い顔で、ウケそうになっちゃって！", "zh": "这也没办法啦～！哈哈哈☆\n我看到奈绪～她们的坏人脸也差点笑出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1031_027say", "source_sha256": "5054945c908715db4d533b649548366ed5062bd6b4f877cabf506c4993ad9afa", "ja": "ふふっ、気持ちはわかるけど、集中しないとね。\n休憩中に、切り替えていこうっ！", "zh": "呵呵，我能明白你们的心情，不过还是得专心才行喔。\n就在休息时间里调整好心态吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "17db88d5345bd89de9f88946b68e012e29ab308507185f3ad6ae38a9a32f311f", "ja": "アカンな～、自分でもバーニングって言うたび、\n笑いそうになるもん……集中、集中！", "zh": "吼～我自己也是每次说到燃烧，\n就会差点笑出来……要专心，要专心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "86aac7ebe9c7be00d7d6a6524e7697ea1e30b95f2f407aa9c4251120c51514ca", "ja": "笑われちゃうってことは、迫力が足りないのよね……。\nはぁ……みんなちゃんとできて、すごいなぁ。", "zh": "会被笑就代表我的魄力还不够呢……\n唉……大家都演得好好，好厉害喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1034_p", "source_sha256": "bcac1aa9f7f9bcfab1656d79d3d64ff4bbe239d970092713948e4f122e8ce2bf", "ja": "風花、まだ演技に悩んでるのか？\n見たところ、かなりできてると思うけど。", "zh": "风花，你还在烦恼该怎么演吗？\n在我看来，你演得很好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1035_041fuk", "source_sha256": "eb2dcdf4a11524619c8ac814426708d749a4fde20a33f79bec79043ec51533ec", "ja": "{$P$}さん、そんな……。\n自分でもわかってます。なんとかやれてるだけだって。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你别安慰我了……\n我自己也很清楚，这只是勉强演出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "a98cd2b29708088e75d20f08616d02cab7fed9c88d2cd38ce0be75eb0c3438bf", "ja": "うーん、そうか……？\nまあそう思うなら、ちょっと相談してみるか。", "zh": "嗯～会吗……？\n但既然你这么想，那就再找人讨论看看好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1037_041fuk", "source_sha256": "62587179ae5e5470f65534b7e0fdcedbef4f9578e75df29bada7fde6b0f04da3", "ja": "相談って、誰にですか？", "zh": "你是说找谁讨论？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "39da327aea9670aaf6c247250369ce1c2942f65640c6e740ab9beafbce17c518", "ja": "そうだな。ここは……。", "zh": "这个嘛，这种时候就要找……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_1039", "source_sha256": "e001f48998026e8b271b236294d7b82b955caf332d3b6f5055de4db3fea3dfe3", "ja": "海美！", "zh": "海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "3e43e65ee10e4f755014d5608981ced6e02f452cdbd3fb991555329d7e267ddf", "ja": "おーい、海美！　ちょっと来てくれ！", "zh": "喂～海美！你过来一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d51e02baa5531e7863ffd4366063c25daebcd133dd2aca9247ddb7c2fe51f1b5", "ja": "えっ、海美ちゃんにですか？\n海美ちゃん、悪役じゃないのに……？", "zh": "咦，和海美讨论吗？\n海美她不是演反派欸……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2002_p", "source_sha256": "19c169ed3085adc3c1fcb75a0ac521c908e4e3afb83824b40cf7f61d89f091ca", "ja": "だからこそだ。\n別の視点から話が聞けるかもしれないからな。", "zh": "所以才找她啊。\n说不定能获得不同视角的意见呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2003_029umi", "source_sha256": "8d5dfa7cd3f8b5454f501199bf0e5ad155d5c8fe10c1f7d3a185c502728fcb25", "ja": "はいはーいっ！\nなになに？　{$P$}！", "zh": "来了来了～！\n什么事啊？{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2004_p", "source_sha256": "4dbabaa30c90b589f1d199d190a1bd16a522a6d49d87351f3e4e4bfac945c078", "ja": "今、風花と演技の方向性について話してるんだけど、\nちょっとアドバイスが欲しいんだ。", "zh": "我在和风花聊诠释角色的方向，\n想要听一下你的建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2005_029umi", "source_sha256": "66e72b8b8c71062d0a554b1a0e5a1982e82ceb3cca2d418e199826a2634bdd7d", "ja": "えっ？　アドバイスって、演技の？\n私がふーちゃんに？　ちゃんとできるかなぁ……。", "zh": "什么？建议是指演技方面吗？\n要我给小风建议？我能给出好建议吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2006_p", "source_sha256": "49820b377e6f9777acf242daf3fe3b43836f6b73f22f4a6ee7b81a04f736dee2", "ja": "海美は今回、役を掴むのがすごく早かったよな？\nなにかコツでもあったのか？", "zh": "海美不是很快就掌握住角色了吗？\n有没有什么诀窍可以分享？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "668608d3670e1f91cfd4a45d034c603dbf894ef9235ca93dc34f1edcf718308d", "ja": "確かに海美ちゃん、すごかったですよね……。\n海美ちゃん、教えてくれる？", "zh": "对啊，海美很厉害呢……\n海美，你可以告诉我诀窍吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2008_029umi", "source_sha256": "e46f7b8db4a34944db2d9f2eb49e9c336909a7215a25563c3e33d1ccf526517b", "ja": "えっと……うん、わかったっ！\nうみみんアドバイス☆　してみるねっ。", "zh": "我想想……嗯，我知道了！\n就给你一点海美美建议吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2009_029umi", "source_sha256": "54868f10a2902690bf30ae5847c6e475a6da5f719a28713af9504ae28b45431f", "ja": "あのね、私、お姉ちゃんがいるんだけど……。\nあ、さよちんじゃなくてね？", "zh": "我跟你说喔，我有一个姊姊……\n啊，我不是在说纱纱喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2010_p", "source_sha256": "ea101eac6b8c399914d1517ca326b1c5857f920af3485acd72f62689474ed819", "ja": "海美の、本当のお姉さんの話か？", "zh": "是指海美你的亲姊姊对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2011_029umi", "source_sha256": "93712f57cfc6c760ff860e17918999e609c7bf49ff524d08df769cd6794f9a82", "ja": "そうそう！　小さい頃、そっちのお姉ちゃんと\n遊んでて、ケガさせちゃったことがあったの。", "zh": "对对！小时候有一次我在和姊姊玩的时候，\n不小心害姊姊受伤了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2012_029umi", "source_sha256": "e9de14e18e525caac0a98ede607a0d93d46852bb44fbd9480be66a65d1d6fc64", "ja": "そのせいでお姉ちゃん、バレエのコンクールに\n出られなくてね……私、悲しくて悔しくてっ！", "zh": "姊姊因此不能参加芭蕾舞比赛……\n我很伤心，很后悔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2013_029umi", "source_sha256": "7301aba19c4fc67e505f8ec0159be03cd9e7dd3d6dadb126279263ba3b7de406", "ja": "そのときの気持ちを思い出しながら、\n演技してるんだよね～。そしたら、うまくいくんだ☆", "zh": "我在演戏的时候，都会一边回想当时的感受～\n然后就能演得很顺利了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2014_p", "source_sha256": "35dec4e14ab87fb4eadda96584dc101f655d83c3c59b7231f3609e133e998573", "ja": "なるほど、そんなことが……。", "zh": "原来发生过这种事啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3e0fd42501f37b23abf7ffbd7a6f3a224ed1fa5f6c0aed304011c8c4cb55b530", "ja": "海美ちゃん、すごい……！\nそこまで、役柄と自分を重ねてたんだ……。", "zh": "海美你好厉害……！\n原来你把角色的心境和自己重叠得这么深……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "dd5287aa3b50473a5b2352b0dc43f54a73b3227a119f014781a30eec98b48392", "ja": "私は、自分とは違うって思ってばっかりで、\nキングと真っ直ぐ、向き合えてなかったなぁ……。", "zh": "我一直只想着我和角色不一样，\n都没有好好去正视王者……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2017_p", "source_sha256": "4ad2c8605eda20e5c29ed40703fcc359e8e6bb74932391d0c37f5e1beca2881f", "ja": "それはどうかな。本当に向き合ってなかったら、\n悩みもしないと思うけど。", "zh": "会吗？我是觉得如果你真的没有正视她，\n应该也不会为此烦恼吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a9423ab7ca0949cf56ec0a764f2901a0b6f5367577f2d7634081e5571940ef43", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nでも私、今ならもっとキングのこと、わかりそうです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n但是我现在，感觉更能够理解王者了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ca44c1f616514bdf615c31960788babfa15234e4525cb381ae129f6a64022426", "ja": "すごい才能を持って生まれて、それ以外の生き方を\n選べなかった。でも、イヤなだけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "她生来就拥有出色才能，所以无法选择不同的生活方式。\n但她对此并不单纯只有感到厌烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "01b31131baa86829535cb125d19da6445499bf8cb9663331eeef1ee3fddfda5f", "ja": "みんなの期待に応えたいって思いもあって……。\nそんな複雑な気持ち……私、わかる気がします！", "zh": "她同时也想要回应大家的期待……\n这种复杂的心情……我好像能体会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2021_p", "source_sha256": "25ebc1f5ebb8ea6c294588bb05f30ecb4e02dd5ccf7335eec4afc8736c07206a", "ja": "おっ。何かつかめたか？", "zh": "哦，有抓到什么诀窍了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9511362e5fc0b12dbc7bbe63547f0e554ea204f548620c41b5351d69c7f53b43", "ja": "はい……多分！\n海美ちゃん、ありがとう！　海美ちゃんのおかげだよ♪", "zh": "是的……应该吧！\n海美，谢谢你！都是多亏了有海美帮忙♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2023_029umi", "source_sha256": "add3fb5111de6006b4f61331c3ee4f1592ad10bc83c81f0bc6b0e09c22ff70f9", "ja": "うんうんっ！　ふーちゃんの役に立てたなら\nうれしいよっ☆　一緒にいい映画にしようねーっ！", "zh": "嗯嗯！能帮上小风的忙，我很高兴☆\n一起拍出好电影吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2024_041fuk", "source_sha256": "363d4050b21f142df89387d37e500a3a90cbdc58d2504a62b73a0186cc133d62", "ja": "うん♪　{$P$}さんも、\n相談に乗ってくれて、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "嗯♪{$P$}先生，\n我也要谢谢你倾听我的烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4182217718d86deebe2a5b8b60429cf136352e7b176bc82809193b630a9aa705", "ja": "私とキングのこと、見ててくださいね？\nきっと……もっといい演技を見せますから！", "zh": "你要看着我和王者喔。\n我一定……会展现出更棒的演技！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2026_p", "source_sha256": "dceadd620f27e5a49c48310378b5d5e22ba28c4a747a7a80a8a572b392723765", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！　期待させてもらうよ。", "zh": "嗯，当然！我会好好期待的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_04_2027_p", "source_sha256": "ca1c87f27f4229f06f64d226b5ee63e1ce5c180894a2239c05d57a39cce26708", "ja": "（今日見た限り、風花の演技は見事なものだった。\n今以上の進化が望めるとは……驚かされっぱなしだな）", "zh": "（今天这样看下来，风花的演技已相当精湛。没想到还能\n看到她演得更棒……她们总是会带给我惊喜呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
